You are an expert Flutter runtime engineer. Analyze the following caching logic for a high-frequency ListView. Identify memory leaks, evaluate asymptotic time and space complexity, and rewrite the method to minimize unnecessary object allocations on the UI thread.

```dart
class CacheManager {
  final Map<String, dynamic> _cache = {};
  List<String> getKeys() => _cache.keys.toList();
  void put(String key, dynamic val) {
    if (_cache.length > 500) {
      _cache.remove(_cache.keys.first);
    }
    _cache[key] = val;
  }
  dynamic get(String key) => _cache[key];
}
```

Provide concrete performance recommendations concerning garbage collection pauses, LRU eviction efficiency, and compute thread isolation.
